[chant:patthana-matika-patha]
[04:53.44]1 Hetu-paccayo, ārammaṇa-paccayo,
[04:58.68]2 adhipati-paccayo, anantara-paccayo,
[05:03.63]3 samanantara-paccayo, saha-jāta-paccayo,
[05:09.30]4 aññam-añña-paccayo, nissaya-paccayo,
[05:14.57]5 upanissaya-paccayo, pure-jāta-paccayo,
[05:20.14]6 pacchā-jāta-paccayo, āsevana-paccayo,
[05:26.22]7 kamma-paccayo, vipāka-paccayo,
[05:30.68]8 āhāra-paccayo, indriya-paccayo,
[05:36.21]9 jhāna-paccayo, magga-paccayo,
[05:40.35]10 sampayutta-paccayo, vippayutta-paccayo,
[05:46.11]11 atthi-paccayo, n'atthi-paccayo,
[05:50.46]12 vigata-paccayo, avigata-paccayo.

[chant:vipassana-bhumi-patha]
[05:55.82]1 Pañcakkhandhā:
[05:57.85]2 Rūpakkhandho, vedanākkhandho, saññākkhandho, saṅkhārakkhandho, viññāṇakkhandho.
[06:10.11]3 Dvā-das'āyatanāni:
[06:12.67]4 Cakkhv-āyatanaṁ rūp'āyatanaṁ,
[06:17.02]5 Sot'āyatanaṁ sadd'āyatanaṁ,
[06:21.36]6 Ghān'āyatanaṁ gandh'āyatanaṁ,
[06:25.45]7 Jivh'āyatanaṁ ras'āyatanaṁ
[06:29.28]8 Kāy'āyatanaṁ phoṭṭhabb'āyatanaṁ
[06:33.86]9 Man'āyatanaṁ dhamm'āyatanaṁ.
[06:37.67]10 Aṭṭhārasa dhātuyo:
[06:40.84]11 Cakkhu-dhātu rūpa-dhātu cakkhu-viññāṇa-dhātu,
[06:46.76]12 Sota-dhātu sadda-dhātu sota-viññāṇa-dhātu,
[06:52.69]13 Ghāna-dhātu gandha-dhātu ghāna-viññāṇa-dhātu,
[06:58.91]14 Jivhā-dhātu rasa-dhātu jivhā-viññāṇa-dhātu,
[07:05.32]15 Kāya-dhātu phoṭṭhabba-dhātu kāya-viññāṇa-dhātu,
[07:12.30]16 Mano-dhātu dhamma-dhātu mano-viññāṇa-dhātu.
[07:18.27]17 Bā-vīsat'indriyāni:
[07:20.95]18 Cakkhu'ndriyaṁ sot'indriyaṁ ghān'indriyaṁ,
[07:26.77]19 jivh'indriyaṁ kāy'indriyaṁ man'indriyaṁ,
[07:32.14]20 Itth'indriyaṁ puris'indriyaṁ jīvit'indriyaṁ,
[07:37.82]21 Sukh'indriyaṁ dukkh'indriyaṁ,
[07:41.04]22 somanass'indriyaṁ domanass'indriyaṁ upekkh'indriyaṁ,
[07:48.26]23 saddh'indriyaṁ viriy'indriyaṁ sat'indriyaṁ
[07:53.62]24 samādh'indriyaṁ paññ'indriyaṁ,
[07:57.64]25 Anaññātañ-ñassāmī-t'indriyaṁ aññ'indriyaṁ
[08:04.21]26 aññātāv'indriyaṁ.
[08:07.10]27 Cattāri ariya-saccāni:
[08:10.26]28 Dukkhaṁ ariya-saccaṁ,
[08:13.22]29 Dukkha-samudayo ariya-saccaṁ,
[08:17.25]30 Dukkha-nirodho ariya-saccaṁ,
[08:21.10]31 Dukkha-nirodha-gāminī paṭipadā ariya-saccaṁ.
[08:27.27]32 Avijjā-paccayā saṅkhārā,
[08:31.47]33 Saṅkhāra-paccayā viññāṇaṁ,
[08:35.67]34 Viññāṇa-paccayā nāma-rūpaṁ,
[08:40.39]35 Nāma-rūpa-paccayā saḷ-āyatanaṁ,
[08:45.40]36 Saḷ-āyatana-paccayā phasso,
[08:48.85]37 Phassa-paccayā vedanā,
[08:51.84]38 Vedanā-paccayā taṇhā,
[08:56.01]39 Taṇhā-paccayā upādānaṁ,
[09:00.77]40 Upādāna-paccayā bhavo,
[09:04.49]41 Bhava-paccayā jāti,
[09:07.15]42 Jāti-paccayā jarā-maraṇaṁ soka-parideva-dukkha-domanass'upāyāsā sambhavanti.
[09:25.16]43 Evam-etassa kevalassa dukkhakkhandhassa samudayo hoti.
[09:26.96]44 Avijjāya tv-eva asesa-virāga-nirodhā saṅkhāra-nirodho,
[09:35.24]45 Saṅkhāra-nirodhā viññāṇa-nirodho,
[09:40.84]46 Viññāṇa-nirodhā nāma-rūpa-nirodho,
[09:46.32]47 Nāma-rūpa-nirodhā saḷ-āyatana-nirodho,
[09:52.20]48 Saḷ-āyatana-nirodhā phassa-nirodho,
[09:55.65]49 Phassa-nirodhā vedanā-nirodho,
[10:00.03]50 Vedanā-nirodhā taṇhā-nirodho,
[10:07.25]51 Taṇhā-nirodhā upādāna-nirodho,
[10:13.67]52 Upādāna-nirodhā bhava-nirodho,
[10:17.40]53 Bhava-nirodhā jāti-nirodho,
[10:21.29]54 Jāti-nirodhā jarā-maraṇaṁ soka-parideva-dukkha-domanass'upāyāsā nirujjhanti.
[10:32.64]55 Evam-etassa kevalassa dukkhakkhandhassa nirodho hoti.

[chant:karaniya-metta-sutta]
[10:42.53]1 Karaṇīyam-attha-kusalena
[10:45.98]2 Yan-taṁ santaṁ padaṁ abhisamecca
[10:50.32]3 Sakko ujū ca suhujū ca
[10:53.74]4 Suvaco c'assa mudu anatimānī
[10:57.76]5 Santussako ca subharo ca
[11:01.58]6 Appakicco ca sallahuka-vutti
[11:05.40]7 Sant'indriyo ca nipako ca
[11:08.74]8 Appagabbho kulesu ananugiddho
[11:13.40]9 Na ca khuddaṁ samācare kiñci
[11:17.26]10 Yena viññū pare upavadeyyuṁ
[11:21.69]11 Sukhino vā khemino hontu
[11:25.59]12 Sabbe sattā bhavantu sukhit'attā
[11:29.90]13 Ye keci pāṇa-bhūt'atthi
[11:33.52]14 Tasā vā thāvarā vā anavasesā
[11:38.31]15 Dīghā vā ye mahantā vā
[11:42.53]16 Majjhimā rassakā aṇuka-thūlā
[11:46.80]17 Diṭṭhā vā ye ca adiṭṭhā
[11:51.02]18 Ye ca dūre vasanti avidūre
[11:55.21]19 Bhūtā vā sambhavesī vā
[11:59.46]20 Sabbe sattā bhavantu sukhit'attā
[12:04.05]21 Na paro paraṁ nikubbetha
[12:07.47]22 Nātimaññetha katthaci naṁ kiñci
[12:11.64]23 Byārosanā paṭighasaññā
[12:15.74]24 Nāññam-aññassa dukkham-iccheyya
[12:20.00]25 Mātā yathā niyaṁ puttaṁ
[12:23.61]26 Āyusā eka-puttam-anurakkhe
[12:28.15]27 Evam'pi sabba-bhūtesu
[12:31.65]28 Mānasam-bhāvaye aparimāṇaṁ
[12:36.12]30 Mettañ-ca sabba-lokasmiṁ
[12:39.76]31 Mānasam-bhāvaye aparimāṇaṁ
[12:44.20]32 Uddhaṁ adho ca tiriyañ-ca
[12:47.65]33 Asambādhaṁ averaṁ asapattaṁ
[12:52.51]34 Tiṭṭhañ-caraṁ nisinno vā
[12:55.84]35 Sayāno vā yāvat'assa vigata-middho
[13:01.57]36 Etaṁ satiṁ adhiṭṭheyya
[13:04.78]37 Brahmam-etaṁ vihāraṁ idham-āhu
[13:09.61]38 Diṭṭhiñca anupagamma
[13:13.15]39 Sīlavā dassanena sampanno
[13:16.97]40 Kāmesu vineyya gedhaṁ
[13:20.74]41 Na hi jātu gabbha-seyyaṁ punaretī'ti
[13:27.32]
